      "System.Description": "<p><b>Context:</b> Customers with a gift-card balance cannot combine it with a card payment at checkout; they ask support to burn the card in a separate transaction. The checkout payment-list flow is the existing integration point. </p><p><b>Scope:</b> This story allows paying with one gift card plus one card in a single order. Out of scope: multiple gift cards, native apps. </p>",
